# Grammar curriculum master list — source of truth for grammar_curriculum.
# Items follow the publicly available NIKL "국제 통용 한국어 표준 교육과정"
# level bands (grammar items themselves are facts of the language; all
# explanations/examples are generated by our own AI on first open).
#
# Levels: Starter=Seed (TOPIK 1 low) · Beginner=Sprout (TOPIK 1-2)
#         Intermediate=Tree (TOPIK 3-4) · Advanced=Forest (TOPIK 5-6)
# tier:   core    = Grammar Path (ordered, mastery tracked)
#         library = Grammar Library (browse / search / article links)
# The 45 legacy pattern strings are kept verbatim so existing progress
# (keyed by pattern) carries over.
#
# Run:  python3 supabase/seeds/grammar_curriculum.py > supabase/migrations/<file>.sql
